	<regions>
		<region region-id="6" left="6" top="2.25" width="462" height="72" align-x="13.5" align-y="12" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Мы составили манипулятор на основании совокупности наших технических возможностей и требований к роботу и по рабочей области и степени подвижности манипулятора.</p>
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Для того чтобы спроектировать приводы основных (плечевой и локтевой) подвижностей<br/>манипулятора, нам надо рассчитать мощность двигателей. <br/>Мощность будем считать, исходя из момента, уже затем выбирая конкретную модель<br/>двигателя и возможно проектируя редуктор.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="10" left="6" top="90" width="301.5" height="159.75" align-x="6" align-y="90" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<picture>
				<png item-idref="1" display-width="300" display-height="158.25"/>
			</picture>
			<rendering item-idref="2"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="13" left="6" top="260.25" width="435" height="72" align-x="41.25" align-y="270" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Конструкционно робот можно разделить на три части:</p>
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1) Плечо</p>
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2) Локоть</p>
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3) Схват + Нагрузка</p>
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">В силу модульности конструкции захватное устройство и нагрузка рассматриваются абстрактно<br/>с запасом по массе. Конфигурация и реализация захватного устройства может изменяться.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="75" left="6" top="344.25" width="85.5" height="12" align-x="16.5" align-y="354" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<b>Схват + Нагрузка</b>
				</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="61" left="6" top="362.25" width="462" height="24" align-x="18.75" align-y="372" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="0" margin-right="0" text-indent="0" text-align="left" list-style-type="none" tabs="inherit">Масса сервопривода (MG996R) в простом пластиковом корпусе около 0,4 кг. Таких используется не более трёх.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="136" left="6" top="393" width="57" height="12.75" align-x="43.5" align-y="402" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_серв</ml:id>
					<ml:real>0.2</ml:real>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="3"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="137" left="84" top="393" width="9" height="12.75" align-x="87.75" align-y="402" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:id xml:space="preserve" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">кг</ml:id>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="4"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="138" left="6" top="410.25" width="272.25" height="12" align-x="18.75" align-y="420" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Масса захватного устройства ( MG995 ) до 100 г с мотором.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="139" left="6" top="429" width="54.75" height="12.75" align-x="41.25" align-y="438" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_захв</ml:id>
					<ml:real>0.2</ml:real>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="5"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="140" left="84" top="429" width="9" height="12.75" align-x="87.75" align-y="438" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:id xml:space="preserve" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">кг</ml:id>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="6"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="141" left="6" top="446.25" width="150" height="12" align-x="27" align-y="456" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Допустим масса нагрузки до 1 кг</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="142" left="6" top="465" width="49.5" height="12.75" align-x="42.75" align-y="474" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_груз</ml:id>
					<ml:real>1</ml:real>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="7"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="143" left="84" top="465" width="9" height="12.75" align-x="87.75" align-y="474" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:id xml:space="preserve" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">кг</ml:id>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="8"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="144" left="6" top="482.25" width="136.5" height="12" align-x="17.25" align-y="492" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Тогда <b>масса гриппера</b> будет:</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="145" left="6" top="501" width="173.25" height="12.75" align-x="44.25" align-y="510" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_грип</ml:id>
					<ml:apply>
						<ml:plus/>
						<ml:apply>
							<ml:plus/>
							<ml:apply>
								<ml:mult/>
								<ml:real>3</ml:real>
								<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_серв</ml:id>
							</ml:apply>
							<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_захв</ml:id>
						</ml:apply>
						<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_груз</ml:id>
					</ml:apply>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="9"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="146" left="204" top="501" width="61.5" height="12.75" align-x="240.75" align-y="510" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_грип</ml:id>
					<result xmlns="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
						<ml:real>1.8</ml:real>
					</result>
				</ml:eval>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="10"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="147" left="288" top="501" width="9" height="12.75" align-x="291.75" align-y="510" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:id xml:space="preserve" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">кг</ml:id>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="11"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="148" left="6" top="524.25" width="37.5" height="12" align-x="20.25" align-y="534" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">
					<b>Локоть </b>
				</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="149" left="6" top="542.25" width="427.5" height="12" align-x="18.75" align-y="552" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Масса локтя (в неё не входит двигатель, даже если он расположен в сочленении) составляет:</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="150" left="6" top="561" width="58.5" height="12.75" align-x="45" align-y="570" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">m_cubit</ml:id>
					<ml:real>1.4</ml:real>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="12"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="151" left="84" top="561" width="9" height="12.75" align-x="87.75" align-y="570" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:id xml:space="preserve" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">кг</ml:id>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="13"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="152" left="108" top="560.25" width="233.25" height="12" align-x="126.75" align-y="570" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Согласно модели, собранной с учётом материалов.</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="153" left="6" top="578.25" width="275.25" height="12" align-x="18.75" align-y="588" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Длина локтя от оси вращения до конечной точки составляет:</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="154" left="6" top="597" width="57" height="12.75" align-x="43.5" align-y="606" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">L_cubit</ml:id>
					<ml:real>0.5</ml:real>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="14"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="155" left="84" top="597" width="7.5" height="12.75" align-x="87" align-y="606" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:id xml:space="preserve" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">м</ml:id>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="15"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="156" left="108" top="596.25" width="225.75" height="12" align-x="126.75" align-y="606" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="false">
				<p style="Обычный" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Добавим 15 см до <i>условного </i>
					<inlineAttr font-style="normal">центра масс схвата:</inlineAttr>
				</p>
			</text>
		</region>
		<region region-id="157" left="6" top="615" width="126.75" height="12.75" align-x="66" align-y="624" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:define xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">L_cubit_plus</ml:id>
					<ml:apply>
						<ml:plus/>
						<ml:id xml:space="preserve">L_cubit</ml:id>
						<ml:real>0.15</ml:real>
					</ml:apply>
				</ml:define>
			</math>
			<rendering item-idref="16"/>
		</region>
		<region region-id="158" left="204" top="615" width="87.75" height="12.75" align-x="262.5" align-y="624" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="true" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
			<math optimize="false" disable-calc="false">
				<ml:eval placeholderMultiplicationStyle="default" xmlns:ml="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
					<ml:id xml:space="preserve">L_cubit_plus</ml:id>
					<result xmlns="http://schemas.mathsoft.com/math30">
						<ml:real>0.65</ml:real>
					</result>
				</ml:eval>
			</math>
